9
00:01:18,542 --> 00:01:24,292
有几项研究发现，当 Cubic 和 BBR 相互竞争时，它们可能会表现得极其不公平。
And there are several studies that have found that when cubic and BBR compete with each other, they can be extremely unfair.

10
00:01:24,974 --> 00:01:37,796
引用 2019 年的一项研究，他们发现单个 BBR 流能够在与多达 16 个 Cubic 流共享同一个瓶颈
时，获得固定 35% 到 40% 的链路容量份额。
So, just quoting the study from 2019, they found that a single BBR flow was able to get a fixed 35 to 40% share of the link capacity
