11
00:01:38,798 --> 00:01:46,244
因此，在互联网上部署这些所谓的「不公平」算法，自然引发了许多关于公平性的担忧。
So the deployment of these quote-unquote unfair algorithms on the
internet has naturally created many concerns with regards to fairness.

12
00:01:47,886 --> 00:01:58,692
关于公平性的许多讨论，主要集中在呼吁改变这些不公平拥塞控制算法在算法层面的运行方式。
And a lot of this discussion around fairness has centered around making calls for
changing how a lot of these unfair congestion control algorithms operate algorithmically.

13
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:05,124
