There have also been calls for reviewing what we think are deployability standards for modern internet congestion control algorithms.

14
00:02:05,582 --> 00:02:15,280
例如，在 2024 年的 SICOM 上，我们就针对为了确保互联网公平性，
这些现代部署标准应该是什么样进行了社区讨论。
So, for example, at SICOM in 2024, we had a community discussion on what we think these modern deployability standards should look
