15
00:02:15,790 --> 00:02:19,600
目前在 IETF 也有很多类似的讨论正在进行。
There are many similar discussions happening at the IETF currently.

16
00:02:20,398 --> 00:02:25,476
但我发现有趣的一点是，我们已经在互联网上做拥塞控制几十年了。
But what I find interesting about this is that we've been doing congestion control on the internet for decades.

